# Label the device health HAL binary so init can transition it into the
# hal_health_default domain. Without this the binary keeps the generic
# vendor_file label and init refuses to start the 'class hal' service
# ("incorrect label or no domain transition") — even in permissive mode —
# so IHealth/default never registers and BatteryService hangs the boot.
# Reuses the same exec type AOSP gives android.hardware.health-service.example.
/(vendor|system/vendor)/bin/hw/android\.hardware\.health-service\.dragon_q6a    u:object_r:hal_health_default_exec:s0
